sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: EFZ — guardian и controlled descendant lifecycle
    accDescr: Guardian владеет процессами и coverage независимо от coordinator. Final result возвращается после DOWN, trace barriers и проверки dirty runner.
    autonumber
    participant W as Worker / caller
    participant G as Guardian<br/>efz_guardian
    participant C as Coordinator<br/>efz_executor
    participant T as Root target<br/>M:run(Input)
    participant D as Controlled<br/>descendants
    participant O as Observation ETS
    participant I as Integrity helpers<br/>efz_cov_integrity
    W->>G: spawn_monitor
    G->>G: Independent IO group, monitor caller
    G->>I: Check pinned harness and selected builds
    G->>O: open context, new execution Ref
    G->>I: Create protected PID registry, enable context/code traces
    G->>C: spawn_monitor
    G->>T: spawn_monitor, closed start gate
    G->>I: Register root expected context before gate
    G->>C: coordinate root
    C->>T: monitor
    C-->>G: coordinator_ready
    G->>T: start_owned
    T->>T: attach context, invoke target
    opt Controlled child creation
        T->>G: spawn_owned(Capability, Fun)
        G->>D: gated spawn, monitor, trace, record ownership
        G->>I: Register child expected context
        G-->>T: child PID
        T->>D: start_owned
        D->>D: attach shared coverage context, execute Fun
        D->>O: probes, including nested children
    end
    T->>O: root probes
    T-->>G: First published probes / sticky hook failures
    G->>G: Receive context mutation / code loading traces
    alt Root completes or crashes
        T-->>C: target_result + DOWN
        C-->>G: coordinator_done(Outcome)
    else Timeout, caller death or coordinator death
        G->>G: deadline or monitor DOWN wins
    end
    G->>G: Stop admissions, begin cleanup
    G->>T: kill
    G->>D: kill every owned process
    G->>C: kill / wait DOWN
    T-->>G: DOWN
    D-->>G: DOWN for all descendants
    G->>G: Per-process trace delivery barriers
    Note over G,D: Late uncontrolled spawn adds a monitor and barrier, marks run dirty
    G->>G: Global loader trace delivery barrier
    G->>I: Recheck code identities, attachment and sticky failures
    G->>O: snapshot, validate probes and saved observations, close
    G->>I: Close registry
    G->>G: Destroy tracing, check shared-state changes
    alt Processes confirmed and no violations
        alt Coverage integrity confirmed
            G-->>W: Observed or valid empty coverage, cleanup confirmed
        else Context, build or observation invalid
            G-->>W: Infrastructure failure, broken coverage observation
        end
    else Cleanup unconfirmed or contract violated
        G->>G: Persist dirty VM marker
        G-->>W: Infrastructure dirty_runner, reusable false
    end
    G-->>W: Guardian DOWN
    W->>W: Return final execution result
    Note over W,G: If guardian itself dies, caller returns unconfirmed dirty-runner and forbids VM reuse
